  "remarks": "\nRadioavtomatika is engaged in the supply of electronic components. As such, it is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by carrying on business in the electronics sector, a sector of strategic significance to Government of Russia.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
